{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"REM ========================================\nREM LANDSCAPE PROFILER\nREM Identify bottlenecks\nREM ========================================\n\nSCREEN 320, 240\nPAPERG 0\nINKG 15\n\nPRINT \u0022PROFILING LANDSCAPE RENDERER\u0022\nPRINT \u0022==============================\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\n\nREM Test 1: Pure SIN calculation\nPRINT \u0022Test 1: SIN overhead...\u0022\nt1 = TICKS\nFOR i = 0 TO 10000\n  result = SIN(i * 0.05)\nNEXT i\nt2 = TICKS\nsinTime = t2 - t1\nPRINT \u002210k SIN calls: \u0022 \u0026 STR$(sinTime) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Per call: \u0022 \u0026 STR$(sinTime / 10000) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nWAIT 1000\n\nREM Test 2: Double SIN (landscape style)\nPRINT \u0022Test 2: Double SIN (your code)...\u0022\nt1 = TICKS\nFOR i = 0 TO 10000\n  result = SIN(i * 0.05) * 30 \u002B SIN(i * 0.02) * 50\nNEXT i\nt2 = TICKS\ndoubleSinTime = t2 - t1\nPRINT \u002210k Double SIN: \u0022 \u0026 STR$(doubleSinTime) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Per call: \u0022 \u0026 STR$(doubleSinTime / 10000) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nWAIT 1000\n\nREM Test 3: LINE drawing\nPRINT \u0022Test 3: LINE performance...\u0022\nt1 = TICKS\nFOR i = 0 TO 1000\n  LINE 0, 120, 319, 120\nNEXT i\nt2 = TICKS\nlineTime = t2 - t1\nPRINT \u00221000 horizontal LINEs: \u0022 \u0026 STR$(lineTime) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Per line: \u0022 \u0026 STR$(lineTime / 1000) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nWAIT 1000\n\nREM Test 4: Full landscape loop\nPRINT \u0022Test 4: Full landscape render...\u0022\nt1 = TICKS\nFOR frame = 0 TO 59\n  CLSG 0\n  FOR z = 180 TO 1 STEP -3\n    worldZ = z\n    height = SIN(worldZ * 0.05) * 30 \u002B SIN(worldZ * 0.02) * 50\n    screenY = 120 \u002B height\n    IF screenY \u003E= 0 AND screenY \u003C 240 THEN\n      LINE 0, screenY, 319, screenY\n    ENDIF\n  NEXT z\n  WAIT VBL\nNEXT frame\nt2 = TICKS\nfullTime = t2 - t1\navgFrame = fullTime / 60\nPRINT \u002260 frames: \u0022 \u0026 STR$(fullTime) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Avg frame: \u0022 \u0026 STR$(avgFrame) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022FPS: \u0022 \u0026 STR$(INT(1000 / avgFrame))\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nWAIT 1000\n\nREM Test 5: Just loops (no drawing)\nPRINT \u0022Test 5: Pure loop overhead...\u0022\nt1 = TICKS\nFOR frame = 0 TO 59\n  FOR z = 180 TO 1 STEP -3\n    worldZ = z\n    height = SIN(worldZ * 0.05) * 30 \u002B SIN(worldZ * 0.02) * 50\n    screenY = 120 \u002B height\n  NEXT z\nNEXT frame\nt2 = TICKS\nloopTime = t2 - t1\nPRINT \u002260 frames (no draw): \u0022 \u0026 STR$(loopTime) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Drawing overhead: \u0022 \u0026 STR$(fullTime - loopTime) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nWAIT 1000\n\nREM Calculate breakdown\nCLSG\nPRINT \u0022=====================================\u0022\nPRINT \u0022     PERFORMANCE BREAKDOWN\u0022\nPRINT \u0022=====================================\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nPRINT \u0022SIN calls/frame: ~120\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Expected SIN time: \u0022 \u0026 STR$((120 * sinTime / 10000) * 60) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Actual SIN time: \u0022 \u0026 STR$(loopTime) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nPRINT \u0022LINE calls/frame: ~60\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Expected LINE time: \u0022 \u0026 STR$((60 * lineTime / 1000) * 60) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Drawing overhead: \u0022 \u0026 STR$(fullTime - loopTime) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Total frame time: \u0022 \u0026 STR$(avgFrame) \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Target: 16.67 ms (60 FPS)\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\n\nIF avgFrame \u003E 16.67 THEN\n  PRINT \u0022BOTTLENECK IDENTIFIED:\u0022\n  \n  sinOverhead = loopTime / 60\n  drawOverhead = (fullTime - loopTime) / 60\n  \n  IF sinOverhead \u003E drawOverhead THEN\n    PRINT \u0022-\u003E SIN CALCULATIONS (\u0022 \u0026 STR$(INT(sinOverhead)) \u0026 \u0022 ms/frame)\u0022\n    PRINT \u0022   Solution: Use lookup table\u0022\n  ELSE\n    PRINT \u0022-\u003E DRAWING (\u0022 \u0026 STR$(INT(drawOverhead)) \u0026 \u0022 ms/frame)\u0022\n    PRINT \u0022   Solution: Reduce LINE calls\u0022\n  ENDIF\nELSE\n  PRINT \u0022PERFORMANCE: EXCELLENT!\u0022\n  PRINT \u0022No optimization needed\u0022\nENDIF\n\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nPRINT \u0022=====================================\u0022"}